<title>LEBANON: Lebanon September trade deficit at $529.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Lebanon September trade deficit at $529.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's trade deficit fell $80.9 million to $529.9 million in August from $610.8 million a month earlier, the Bank of Lebanon said in its latest monthly bulletin.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	Sept 96    Aug 96	 Sept 95</p>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>    Exports		    100.1	  88.8	  78.6</p>
<p>    Imports		    630.0	 699.6	 613.7</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -529.9	-610.8	-535.1</p>
<p>Year-to-date</p>
<p>    Exports		    742.0	 645.4	 584.6</p>
<p>    Imports		  5,457.0     4,850.6     5,432.1</p>
<p>    Trade balance	 -4,715.2    -4,205.2    -4,847.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
